  "reading": "eFV still predicts WAR; the blend lambda is HOW MUCH to trust eFV's adjustment over the consensus anchor. WAG (realized over/underperformance vs consensus FV = where consensus MISSED) sets lambda ONLY when its predicted-edge -> realized-WAG regression is SIGNIFICANT. As of the 2026 norm-fix that regression is non-significant on BOTH sides (pitchers spearman ~0.001, hitters ~0.066, both bootstrap CIs straddle 0), so a WAG-sized lambda would be noise pinning a rank-suboptimal weight. Both sides therefore defer to the RANK GATE (rank_calibration): pooled + within-tier + FV45-fringe rank rho maximized in a conservative band, which lifts the pooled OOS rank rho vs the old WAG-pinned lambda (the robust, CI-positive part of the available gain). AS SERVED both sides are then PINNED inside that band (hit 0.70, pit 0.57 as of 2026-08-04) rather than re-selected on every matrix rebuild: the composite curve is flat within the band's own noise floor (pooled-rho spread 0.16x the pitcher MDE95, 0.21x the hitter MDE95) so the argmax is not resolvable, while the run-to-run grade churn it caused is. The pins are STABILITY decisions, not accuracy claims - see composite_at_shipped vs composite_at_selected for what each costs on this vintage."
 },
